{"product_id":"nurtureshock-po-bronson-ashley-merryman","title":"Nurtureshock. Po Bronson \u0026 Ashley Merryman","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn a world of modern, involved, caring parents, why are so many kids aggressive and cruel? Where is intelligence hidden in the brain, and why does that matter? Why do cross-racial friendships decrease in schools that are more integrated? If 98% of kids think lying is morally wrong, then why do 98% of kids lie? What's the single most important thing that helps infants learn language?NurtureShock is a groundbreaking collaboration between award-winning science journalists Po Bronson and Ashley Merryman. They argue that when it comes to children, we've mistaken good intentions for good ideas. With impeccable storytelling and razor-sharp analysis, they demonstrate that many of modern society's strategies for nurturing children are in fact backfiring--because key twists in the science have been overlooked.Nothing like a parenting manual, the authors' work is an insightful exploration of themes and issues that transcend children's (and adults') lives.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 135 x 215\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Po Bronson | Ashley Merryman\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780091933777\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 352\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45252480467097,"sku":"16RA-3-9780091933777","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67e2870e641fc_Nurtureshock._20Po_20Bronson_20_20Ashley_20Merryman_20Po_20Bronson_20__20Ashley_20Merryman.webp?v=1743093751","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/nurtureshock-po-bronson-ashley-merryman","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}